<title>UK: Centrica up to 4-month high on UBS upgrade.</title>
<headline>Centrica up to 4-month high on UBS upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Centrica Plc resumed their advance on Wednesday, rising to a four-month high after brokerage UBS upgraded tits recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1434 GMT the shares were up four pence to 76-1/4 on volume of 20 million shares.</p>
<p>UBS said it upgraded the stock to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; after attending a company presentation last Friday.</p>
<p>The brokerage cited management's confidence that the company can maintain profit margins. It did not upgrade its earnings forcasts.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
